  "Role_FcFlag": "Forecast flag (0=actual · 1=FC · 2=preliminary)",
  "RoleDesc_Category": "Axis or structure field — supports multiple columns for drill-down and a table row tree. Dates render automatically as \"Mar 26\". Optional since 1.41: leave it empty and the visual renders a single KPI tile/column labeled with the actual measure's name.",
  "RoleDesc_Actual": "Actual (AC) value — the primary measure. Required unless a forecast measure is bound instead.",
  "RoleDesc_PreviousYear": "Previous year (PY) value, used as one of the variance comparison bases (ΔPY).",
  "RoleDesc_Plan": "Plan/Budget measure. Rendered as outlined columns (IBCS notation) and used as the ΔPL variance basis.",
  "RoleDesc_Forecast": "Forecast (FC) value, shown hatched. Displayed only where actual is missing — unless chart.acFcSplit is set to full/rest, which renders a split column (AC base + FC top).",
  "RoleDesc_Benchmark": "Benchmark (BM) value per category — shown as a dash marker on charts and as a bullet indicator on KPI cards.",
  "RoleDesc_PrevForecast": "Forecast from the previous cycle. Enables the \"fcrev\" variance basis (ΔFC vs. last forecast) to show what shifted since the prior forecast.",
  "RoleDesc_LineMeasure": "Second measure drawn as a combo line over the columns on its own right-hand scale (e.g. margin %). Available only in columns orientation.",
  "RoleDesc_Series": "Splits Actual by an additional dimension and stacks the columns/bars by that series, with legend and stack-total labels.",
  "RoleDesc_ColGroup": "Table/matrix only: pivots the values into column groups (e.g. quarter → month, max. 2 levels), turning the plain table into a matrix with a collapsible column hierarchy.",
  "RoleDesc_FilterInfo": "Text measure carrying the current filter context (e.g. via CONCATENATEX/SELECTEDVALUE) — shown as a second footer line when the filter footer is enabled.",
  "RoleDesc_Comments": "Text measure — categories with a comment get a numbered marker (①②…) and the text appears in the footnote panel.",
  "RoleDesc_Multiples": "Splits the chart into small-multiple tiles per group, all sharing the same scale (IBCS small multiples).",
  "RoleDesc_RowType": "Waterfall/P&L only: \"sum\" marks a subtotal/anchor row, \"delta\" a movement row, \"pct\" a margin row (shown as %, with variance in percentage points).",
  "RoleDesc_FcFlag": "Alternative to a separate FC measure: 1/true marks the AC value as forecast (hatched); 2 or \"prelim\" marks it as preliminary actual (solid bar with thin overlay hatching); 0/blank means a normal actual.",
