  "Desc_Table_TotalRowPos": "Where the Σ total row sits: “Bottom” (default, German P&L reading) below all rows, “Top” right under the header (IBCS). Stays frozen while scrolling.",
  "Table_ZebraStripes": "Zebra stripes",
  "Desc_Table_ZebraStripes": "Shades every second data row with a very subtle background — easier row tracking in wide tables. Off in high-contrast mode. Off by default.",
  "Table_RowDensity": "Row density",
  "Desc_Table_RowDensity": "Row height: “Compact” for dense tables, “Normal” (default) as before, “Airy” for more whitespace. Scales only the cap; very tall visuals stay bounded.",
  "Table_GridLines": "Grid lines",
  "Desc_Table_GridLines": "Separator style: “Horizontal” (default) row lines only, “None” for a calm look, “Horizontal + vertical” adds subtle column/block dividers.",
